      "value": "Although this is a good idea, you also have to think about the people that decide to ignore the avatar tags for two reasons (\"if im honest, ill get banned for uploading it\" or \"if im honest, i wont be able to upload this avatar\"), especially if they havent been informed that VRChat TOS allows for NSFW content as long as you keep it in (Invite or Invite+)",
