      "value": "@{5b3406530132a20f8f95c128|full_name}: Yes, verser is spot on.\n\nNot only that while there will be some people who choose to ignore it, the moderation workload will still be significantly reduced since generally more people tend to follow guidelines than not, and most NSFW creators I know are the ones who are most careful about never bringing their NSFW creations to public worlds. Of course that's some level of confirmation bias judging from the circles I'm involved with, but it's safe to assume that most VRChat denizens wish to keep their account functional.",
      "viewerReactions": null
